# n-C26H54/def2-TZVP, B3LYP (VWN-RPA = B3LYP/G), C-PCM water: the system of scripts/node2_pcm.sh in ORCA 6.1.1.
# ORCA out of the box: RIJCOSX and ORCA's own CPCM(Water) parameters and discretization. ORCA's default grid (DefGrid2); its CPCM radii are 1.2 x Bondi, as PySCF's.
! B3LYP/G def2-TZVP TightSCF CPCM(Water)
%pal nprocs 6 end
%maxcore 1800
* xyzfile 0 1 c26h54.xyz
